                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "It is designed for senior leaders transferring from a company abroad to run its U.S. subsidiary, branch, or affiliate.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "Your spouse and children under 21 receive green cards alongside you.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "Unlike EB-5, an EB-1C green card does not carry a 2-year conditional period.",
                            "product_hero_content_text_subs": false
                        },
                        {
                            "product_hero_content_text_item": "After at least 5 years as permanent residents, and once you meet the requirements, you and your family may apply for U.S. citizenship.",
